{
 "title": "枚举与 match",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "**`enum`** 列出一个值可以取的选项（**变体**）。要查看枚举值，使用 **`match`**。它最重要的特点是：编译器会检查是否处理了**所有情况**。如果漏掉一个变体，代码就无法编译。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "enum TrafficLight:",
    "    Red",
    "    Yellow",
    "    Green",
    "",
    "fn action(light: TrafficLight):",
    "    match light:",
    "        TrafficLight.Red:",
    "            print(\"Stop!\")",
    "        TrafficLight.Yellow:",
    "            print(\"Get ready...\")",
    "        TrafficLight.Green:",
    "            print(\"Go!\")",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    action(TrafficLight.Red)",
    "    action(TrafficLight.Green)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "Stop!",
    "Go!"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "如果不想把它们全部写出来，`_:` 会接住其余所有情况。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "enum TrafficLight:",
    "    Red",
    "    Yellow",
    "    Green",
    "",
    "fn is_stop(light: TrafficLight) -> bool:",
    "    match light:",
    "        TrafficLight.Red:",
    "            return true",
    "        _:",
    "            return false",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    print(is_stop(TrafficLight.Red), is_stop(TrafficLight.Yellow))"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "true false"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c06-l01-x1",
   "prompt": "对枚举 `Direction`（`North`、`South`、`East`、`West`），编写 `name(d)`：输出它自己的名字（`north`、`south`……）。对 `West` 调用它。",
   "starter": [
    "enum Direction:",
    "    North",
    "    South",
    "    East",
    "    West",
    "",
    "fn name(d: Direction):",
    "    match d:",
    "        Direction.North:",
    "            print(\"north\")",
    "        _:",
    "            print(\"?\")",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    name(Direction.West)"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "enum Direction:",
    "    North",
    "    South",
    "    East",
    "    West",
    "",
    "fn name(d: Direction):",
    "    match d:",
    "        Direction.North:",
    "            print(\"north\")",
    "        Direction.South:",
    "            print(\"south\")",
    "        Direction.East:",
    "            print(\"east\")",
    "        Direction.West:",
    "            print(\"west\")",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    name(Direction.West)"
   ],
   "hint": "为每个变体写一个分支；不要使用 `_`。",
   "expected": [
    "west"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c06-l01-q1",
   "q": "如果在 `match` 中漏掉一个变体会怎样？",
   "options": [
    "运行时崩溃",
    "代码无法编译",
    "被悄悄跳过"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "`match` 是穷尽的：缺少一种情况就是编译错误。"
  }
 ]
}
